) VALUES (
    'four-hills-tournament-history',
    '{"en": "The Four Hills Tournament: Ski Jumping''s New Year Tradition", "de": "Die Vierschanzentournee: Neujahrstraditon des Skispringens", "fr": "La Tournée des Quatre Tremplins : Tradition du Nouvel An du saut à ski", "it": "Il Torneo dei Quattro Trampolini: Tradizione di Capodanno del salto con gli sci", "es": "El Torneo de los Cuatro Trampolines: Tradición de Año Nuevo del salto de esquí", "pt": "O Torneio dos Quatro Trampolins: Tradição de Ano Novo do salto de esqui", "nl": "Het Vierschansentoernooi: Nieuwjaarstraditie van schansspringen", "ar": "بطولة التلال الأربعة: تقليد رأس السنة للقفز على الجليد", "ja": "四丘トーナメント：スキージャンプの新年の伝統", "zh": "Si Tiao Qiu Bisai: Huaxue Tiaoyue de Xinnian Chuantong", "ko": "4힐스 토너먼트: 스키점프의 새해 전통"}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "The Vierschanzentournee unites two countries, four legendary hills, and ski jumping''s most intense competition across New Year. This tournament is unlike any other in winter sports.", "de": "Die Vierschanzentournee vereint zwei Länder, vier legendäre Schanzen und den intensivsten Wettkampf des Skispringens über den Jahreswechsel.", "fr": "La Tournée des Quatre Tremplins unit deux pays, quatre collines légendaires et la compétition la plus intense du saut à ski pendant le Nouvel An.", "it": "Il Torneo dei Quattro Trampolini unisce due paesi, quattro colline leggendarie e la competizione più intensa del salto con gli sci durante il Capodanno.", "es": "El Torneo de los Cuatro Trampolines une dos países, cuatro colinas legendarias y la competición más intensa del salto de esquí durante el Año Nuevo.", "pt": "O Torneio dos Quatro Trampolins une dois países, quatro colinas lendárias e a competição mais intensa do salto de esqui durante o Ano Novo.", "nl": "Het Vierschansentoernooi verenigt twee landen, vier legendarische heuvels en de meest intense schansspringcompetitie rond de jaarwisseling.", "ar": "تجمع بطولة التلال الأربعة بين بلدين وأربعة تلال أسطورية وأكثر مسابقات القفز على الجليد كثافة خلال رأس السنة", "ja": "四丘トーナメントは、2カ国、4つの伝説的な丘、そして新年をまたぐスキージャンプ最も激しい競争を統合します。", "zh": "Si tiao qiu bisai lianhe liang ge guojia, si ge chuanqi de shanpo, he huaxue tiaoyue zui jilie de jingzheng hengkua xinnian.", "ko": "4힐스 토너먼트는 두 나라, 네 개의 전설적인 언덕, 그리고 새해를 가로지르는 스키점프의 가장 치열한 경쟁을 통합합니다."}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "<p>The Four Hills Tournament (Vierschanzentournee in German) is <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">ski jumping''s</a> most prestigious annual event. Spanning New Year celebrations, this competition across four venues in Germany and Austria has crowned champions for over 70 years.</p><h2>Origins</h2><p>The tournament was founded in 1952, created as a German-Austrian collaboration to promote ski jumping. The first edition took place during the 1952-53 season, establishing what would become one of winter sports'' most beloved traditions.</p><p>The format was revolutionary: four separate competitions whose results combined to determine an overall winner. Athletes couldn''t afford a single bad day.</p><h2>The Four Hills</h2><p><strong>Oberstdorf (Germany):</strong> The tournament begins in the Bavarian Alps. The Schattenbergschanze hosts the opening competition, setting the tone for the battles ahead.</p><p><strong>Garmisch-Partenkirchen (Germany):</strong> The Große Olympiaschanze, site of the 1936 Games, hosts on New Year''s Day. Athletes jump into the new year in one of skiing''s most dramatic settings.</p><p><strong>Innsbruck (Austria):</strong> The Bergiselschanze offers spectacular views over the Tyrolean capital. This modern architectural marvel has hosted generations of champions.</p><p><strong>Bischofshofen (Austria):</strong> The Paul-Ausserleitner-Schanze hosts the finale. Here, the overall champion is crowned as the tournament reaches its climax.</p><h2>The Grand Slam</h2><p>Winning all four competitions—the Grand Slam—is ski jumping''s rarest achievement. Only Sven Hannawald (2001-02), <a href=\"/ryoyu-kobayashi-profile/\">Ryoyu Kobayashi</a> (2018-19), and Kamil Stoch (2017-18) have accomplished this feat.</p><h2>Legends of the Tournament</h2><p>Janne Ahonen holds five overall titles. <a href=\"/ryoyu-kobayashi-profile/\">Ryoyu Kobayashi</a> has dominated recent editions. Austrian legends like Thomas Morgenstern and Polish hero Kamil Stoch have written their names into tournament history.</p><p>German audiences are particularly passionate, with millions watching on television and tens of thousands attending each event.</p><h2>Atmosphere</h2><p>The tournament spans the holiday season, creating a unique festive atmosphere. The Garmisch event on New Year''s Day attracts massive crowds celebrating both the competition and the new year.</p><p>Each hill has its own character and challenges, testing athletes'' adaptability across different conditions and profiles.</p><h2>Modern Champions</h2><p>Athletes like <a href=\"/stefan-kraft-profile/\">Stefan Kraft</a>, <a href=\"/halvor-granerud-profile/\">Halvor Egner Granerud</a>, and <a href=\"/ryoyu-kobayashi-profile/\">Ryoyu Kobayashi</a> continue fighting for Four Hills glory. The tournament remains ski jumping''s ultimate multi-venue test.</p><h2>The Golden Eagle</h2><p>The overall winner receives the Golden Eagle trophy, one of the most recognizable prizes in winter sports. For ski jumpers, few achievements match winning the Four Hills.</p>", "de": "<p>Die Vierschanzentournee ist das prestigeträchtigste jährliche Event im <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">Skispringen</a>. Über den Jahreswechsel hinweg krönt dieser Wettbewerb an vier Austragungsorten in Deutschland und Österreich seit über 70 Jahren Champions.</p><h2>Ursprünge</h2><p>Die Tournee wurde 1952 als deutsch-österreichische Zusammenarbeit zur Förderung des Skispringens gegründet.</p><h2>Die vier Schanzen</h2><p><strong>Oberstdorf:</strong> Die Tournee beginnt in den bayerischen Alpen. <strong>Garmisch-Partenkirchen:</strong> Die Große Olympiaschanze empfängt am Neujahrstag. <strong>Innsbruck:</strong> Die Bergiselschanze bietet spektakuläre Aussichten. <strong>Bischofshofen:</strong> Die Paul-Ausserleitner-Schanze ist Gastgeber des Finales.</p><h2>Legenden</h2><p>Athleten wie <a href=\"/stefan-kraft-profile/\">Stefan Kraft</a> und <a href=\"/ryoyu-kobayashi-profile/\">Ryoyu Kobayashi</a> kämpfen weiterhin um den Tournee-Sieg.</p>", "fr": "<p>La Tournée des Quatre Tremplins est l''événement annuel le plus prestigieux du <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">saut à ski</a>. S''étendant sur les célébrations du Nouvel An, cette compétition à travers quatre sites en Allemagne et en Autriche couronne des champions depuis plus de 70 ans.</p><h2>Origines</h2><p>Le tournoi a été fondé en 1952, créé comme une collaboration germano-autrichienne.</p><h2>Les quatre collines</h2><p><strong>Oberstdorf:</strong> Le tournoi commence dans les Alpes bavaroises. <strong>Garmisch-Partenkirchen:</strong> La Große Olympiaschanze accueille le jour de l''An. <strong>Innsbruck:</strong> La Bergiselschanze offre des vues spectaculaires. <strong>Bischofshofen:</strong> La finale.</p>", "it": "<p>Il Torneo dei Quattro Trampolini è l''evento annuale più prestigioso del <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">salto con gli sci</a>. Attraversando le celebrazioni di Capodanno, questa competizione su quattro sedi in Germania e Austria incorona campioni da oltre 70 anni.</p><h2>Origini</h2><p>Il torneo è stato fondato nel 1952, creato come collaborazione austro-tedesca.</p><h2>Le quattro colline</h2><p><strong>Oberstdorf:</strong> Il torneo inizia nelle Alpi bavaresi. <strong>Garmisch-Partenkirchen:</strong> Ospita a Capodanno. <strong>Innsbruck:</strong> La Bergiselschanze offre viste spettacolari. <strong>Bischofshofen:</strong> La finale.</p>", "es": "<p>El Torneo de los Cuatro Trampolines es el evento anual más prestigioso del <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">salto de esquí</a>.</p><h2>Orígenes</h2><p>El torneo fue fundado en 1952.</p>", "pt": "<p>O Torneio dos Quatro Trampolins é o evento anual mais prestigioso do <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">salto de esqui</a>.</p><h2>Origens</h2><p>O torneio foi fundado em 1952.</p>", "nl": "<p>Het Vierschansentoernooi is het meest prestigieuze jaarlijkse evenement in <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">schansspringen</a>.</p><h2>Oorsprong</h2><p>Het toernooi werd opgericht in 1952.</p>", "ar": "<p>بطولة التلال الأربعة هي الحدث السنوي الأكثر هيبة في <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">القفز على الجليد</a>.</p><h2>الأصول</h2><p>تأسست البطولة في عام 1952.</p>", "ja": "<p>四丘トーナメント（ドイツ語でVierschanzentournee）は、<a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">スキージャンプ</a>で最も権威ある年間イベントです。</p><h2>起源</h2><p>トーナメントは1952年に設立されました。</p>", "zh": "<p>Si tiao qiu bisai shi <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">huaxue tiaoyue</a> zuiju shengwang de niandu saishi.</p><h2>Qiyuan</h2><p>Bisai chengli yu 1952 nian.</p>", "ko": "<p>4힐스 토너먼트(독일어로 Vierschanzentournee)는 <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">스키점프</a>에서 가장 권위 있는 연례 이벤트입니다.</p><h2>기원</h2><p>토너먼트는 1952년에 설립되었습니다.</p>"}'::jsonb,
    'historical',
    'SJ',
    '{"en": "Four Hills Tournament history - The Vierschanzentournee spanning Germany and Austria, ski jumping''s most prestigious New Year competition since 1952.", "de": "Vierschanzentournee Geschichte - Das prestigeträchtigste Neujahrs-Skispringen seit 1952.", "fr": "Histoire de la Tournée des Quatre Tremplins - La compétition de saut à ski la plus prestigieuse du Nouvel An depuis 1952.", "it": "Storia del Torneo dei Quattro Trampolini - La competizione di salto con gli sci più prestigiosa di Capodanno dal 1952.", "es": "Historia del Torneo de los Cuatro Trampolines - La competición de salto de esquí más prestigiosa del Año Nuevo desde 1952.", "pt": "História do Torneio dos Quatro Trampolins - A competição de salto de esqui mais prestigiosa do Ano Novo desde 1952.", "nl": "Vierschansentoernooi geschiedenis - De meest prestigieuze Nieuwjaarswedstrijd in schansspringen sinds 1952.", "ar": "تاريخ بطولة التلال الأربعة - أكثر مسابقات القفز على الجليد هيبة في رأس السنة منذ 1952", "ja": "四丘トーナメントの歴史 - 1952年以来最も権威ある新年のスキージャンプ競技会", "zh": "Si tiao qiu bisai lishi - Zi 1952 nian yilai zuiju shengwang de xinnian huaxue tiaoyue bisai", "ko": "4힐스 토너먼트 역사 - 1952년 이래 가장 권위 있는 새해 스키점프 대회"}'::jsonb,
